    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/76130b72f736f2a303485f930038f098.webp?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were expelled from Heavens and now you have to go back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a tower that will get you back.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect feathers and buy upgrades to build faster.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to choose between 3 difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/80ce6e36e397b00aa03006174f4b18d8.poster.avif?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/80ce6e36e397b00aa03006174f4b18d8.webm?t=1749067142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/80ce6e36e397b00aa03006174f4b18d8.mp4?t=1749067142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/899935611215804a9048491e3bcfa1aa.webp?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goal, no limitations - build to your heart content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/3a40216412da99f47f2c208106d65fb8.poster.avif?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/3a40216412da99f47f2c208106d65fb8.webm?t=1749067142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/3a40216412da99f47f2c208106d65fb8.mp4?t=1749067142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/f260abccb70b72ebd03bda450afebf5c.webp?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanna claim yourself as &quot;The Fastest Mason&quot;? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the fastest or the most effective brick builder out there? Check it out and get to leaderboards so everybody will know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/2e913198348b3cb19bbaadb3491e4fd8.webp?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There always is possibility, that next placed brick will give you a new brick style! So look out for them, and get the entire collection!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/76130b72f736f2a303485f930038f098.webp?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were expelled from Heavens and now you have to go back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a tower that will get you back.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect feathers and buy upgrades to build faster.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to choose between 3 difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/80ce6e36e397b00aa03006174f4b18d8.poster.avif?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/80ce6e36e397b00aa03006174f4b18d8.webm?t=1749067142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/80ce6e36e397b00aa03006174f4b18d8.mp4?t=1749067142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/899935611215804a9048491e3bcfa1aa.webp?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goal, no limitations - build to your heart content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/3a40216412da99f47f2c208106d65fb8.poster.avif?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/3a40216412da99f47f2c208106d65fb8.webm?t=1749067142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/3a40216412da99f47f2c208106d65fb8.mp4?t=1749067142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/f260abccb70b72ebd03bda450afebf5c.webp?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanna claim yourself as &quot;The Fastest Mason&quot;? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the fastest or the most effective brick builder out there? Check it out and get to leaderboards so everybody will know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699350/extras/2e913198348b3cb19bbaadb3491e4fd8.webp?t=1749067142\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There always is possibility, that next placed brick will give you a new brick style! So look out for them, and get the entire collection!</p>",
